<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #fafaf9; padding: 32px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e5e4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px;">
      <tr>
        <td>
          <h1 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 22px; color: #1a1a1a;">Claim your Holistic Health profile</h1>

          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4a4a48;">
            Hi <%= @practitioner.full_name %>,
          </p>

          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4a4a48;">
            You've been added to the Holistic Health directory for natural health practitioners in Germany. To manage your listing — add a photo, bio, opening hours, and more — claim your profile by setting a password.
          </p>

          <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
            <a href="<%= @claim_url %>"
               style="display: inline-block; background: #4a9c58; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">
              Claim my profile
            </a>
          </p>

          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4a4a48; font-size: 14px;">
            Or paste this link into your browser:<br>
            <a href="<%= @claim_url %>" style="color: #40914d; word-break: break-all;"><%= @claim_url %></a>
          </p>

          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.5; color: #6b6b68; font-size: 13px;">
            This link expires on <strong><%= @expires_on.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %></strong>. If it expires or you didn't expect this email, you can safely ignore it.
          </p>

          <p style="margin: 24px 0 0; color: #a0a09d; font-size: 12px;">
            — The Holistic Health team
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
